4n rooli ja selvit\u00e4 ep\u00e4ilytt\u00e4v\u00e4n kahvilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=By-KxKjLSSkQ7kNvwHC6KwR&_nc_oc=AdoXitrbu7SkOMowqNfPkqombwbVvq-HOg1xPUBuN7IdTSmax9JOw0EgXgIN8WSPxAA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af987P2_d4G09J2IB1cCNUfbpQ7noDOd6yKsjCuwIlajHw&oe=6A2D5554"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TMopf9Gy8R8Q7kNvwGLgJXs&_nc_oc=AdqgxlLc0qxfMG9nVIoMwgpWL8v8Rvv7q0WJraA1RQDUO__tzF8r_HQgY5IMIT2p-uU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8dtvBeOylsHrS2SmfFVwrIdgOEz2xQMT7nQzmyG8dTOw&oe=6A2D5A32"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mC7kdZozQ08Q7kNvwEEd1Ut&_nc_oc=AdodOy75SDbT15sFB2GOddQpoj_FiXQtwCpmouvN6rPcK_8zLaxCpAxe-uPdeUBZOKM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_E4kxXN5iu3gmbeGK0zDDnlo6MQthdplI30ZtO40oxjA&oe=6A2D67D5"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.p